## Quality Standards

Every document in the EKB will:

| Standard | How |
|---|---|
| **Explain WHY** | Every decision includes rationale, trade-offs, and alternatives considered |
| **Formal contracts** | Agents use Consumes/Produces/SLA/KPI format, not prose descriptions |
| **Technology comparisons** | Tables comparing alternatives with Pros/Cons/Decision columns |
| **Mermaid diagrams** | System context, sequence, state machine, class, deployment, flow diagrams |
| **Cross-references** | Relative links between documents; no document stands alone |
| **Risk awareness** | Every section identifies risks with mitigation strategies |
| **Enterprise quality** | Consistent heading structure, terminology, version headers |
| **ADR traceability** | Major decisions reference their ADR; ADRs reference the documents they affect |

